WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.775
Section tags name the parts of a page

2
00:00:03.327 --> 00:00:07.452
&lt;header&gt; is the top of the page: the title, and often the menu.

3
00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:14.972
&lt;main&gt; holds the page's main content.

4
00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:20.682
&lt;footer&gt; is the bottom: contact details and small print.

5
00:00:22.248 --> 00:00:26.998
They look like plain text, but their names tell screen readers what each part is.
